  "tutChessS3Exp": "Black’s pawn just advanced 2 squares (d7 → d5, yellow) and landed right beside your pawn. On this turn only, your pawn may capture it diagonally as if it had moved 1 square — that’s En Passant.",
  "tutChessS3A1": "Tap the white pawn on e5.",
  "tutChessS3A2": "Tap the RED square behind the black pawn for En Passant!",
  "tutChessS4Title": "Step 4/4: Pawn Promotion → Checkmate!",
  "tutChessS4Exp": "A pawn reaching the last rank MUST promote to a Queen, Rook, Bishop, or Knight. Black’s King is boxed in by its own pawns — promoting to a Queen on a8 is Checkmate!",
  "tutChessS4A1": "Tap the white pawn on a7.",
